Jenab ships agent-desktop.exe unchanged, next to its own executable, and runs
it as a separate program for desktop control (SPEC 8.10). The version and the
SHA-256 Jenab accepts are pinned in internal/desktop/desktop.go; Jenab checks
the hash before every start and never downloads the program at run time.

